<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.badge.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>Badge 是 gpui-component 徽标组件的 RML 封装，标签为 Badge。无 ElementId 构造（StatelessNoId），支持容器模式包裹子内容。</p>
            <p>核心用法：包裹子元素显示数字徽标，或通过 primary/secondary/danger/success 变体属性显示彩色徽标。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>包裹文本内容，通过 count 显示数字徽标。</p>
            <div h-flex="" gap-4="">
                <Badge>5</Badge>
                <Badge>99+</Badge>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="尺寸(Sizable trait)">
            <p>size 属性控制徽标大小:small/medium/large。</p>
            <div h-flex="" gap-4="">
                <Badge size="small">5</Badge>
                <Badge size="medium">5</Badge>
                <Badge size="large">5</Badge>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="动态徽标(#[computed] + if 条件渲染)">
            <p>点击按钮递增 count,当 count > 99 时显示 "99+"(演示 #[computed] 条件逻辑);切换 size 演示 if 条件渲染:</p>
            <div h-flex="" gap-4="">
                <Badge>{badge_label}</Badge>
                <Badge size="small" if={size_index == 0}>{count}</Badge>
                <Badge size="medium" if={size_index == 1}>{count}</Badge>
                <Badge size="large" if={size_index == 2}>{count}</Badge>
            </div>
            <p>当前 count: {count} | badge_label: {badge_label} | size: {size_label}</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <Button label="count +1" primary="" on-click={on_increment} />
                <Button label="切换 size" on-click={on_cycle_size} />
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
